# Only what the server image is built from (server.Dockerfile); everything else stays out of the
# build context – no .git, no secrets, no local builds.
*
!web
!docs/help
!server
web/node_modules
web/build
web/.svelte-kit
web/src/lib/paraglide
web/test-results
web/playwright-report
server/bin
server/web/dist
server/tmp
**/.env
**/.secrets
